This is a great set of UI refinements. Combining the row selection with the expand action makes the table much cleaner, and assigning fixed widths to the method cards will ensure they look perfectly symmetrical on all screen sizes.
Here are the exact blocks to replace to implement these changes while keeping the animation buttery smooth.
### Step 1: Add the Excel Icon to Imports
Find your icon imports near the top of the file and add TableChartIcon (which looks like a spreadsheet).
**FIND THIS:**
```javascript
import EditNoteIcon from '@mui/icons-material/EditNote';
import UploadFileIcon from '@mui/icons-material/UploadFile';
import { debounce } from "lodash";

```
**REPLACE WITH THIS:**
```javascript
import EditNoteIcon from '@mui/icons-material/EditNote';
import UploadFileIcon from '@mui/icons-material/UploadFile';
import TableChartIcon from '@mui/icons-material/TableChart';
import { debounce } from "lodash";

```
### Step 2: Replace the Table UI (Step 0)
This will remove the Status and Details columns, replace them with Category, trigger the collapse when clicking anywhere on the row, and only show the Description inside.
**FIND THIS ENTIRE BLOCK (Inside Step 0):**
```javascript
          <Paper elevation={2} sx={{ width: '100%', mb: 2, borderRadius: 2, overflow: 'hidden' }}>
            <TableContainer sx={{ overflowX: "hidden" }}>

```
*(Highlight from there all the way down to </Paper> for Step 0)*
**REPLACE WITH THIS:**
```javascript
          <Paper elevation={2} sx={{ width: '100%', mb: 2, borderRadius: 2, overflow: 'hidden' }}>
            <TableContainer sx={{ overflowX: "hidden" }}>
              <Table size="medium" sx={{ tableLayout: "fixed" }}>
                <TableHead sx={{ backgroundColor: "action.hover" }}>
                  <TableRow>
                    <TableCell padding="checkbox" sx={{ width: '5%' }}></TableCell>
                    <TableCell sx={{ fontWeight: 'bold', width: '25%' }}>VID</TableCell>
                    <TableCell sx={{ fontWeight: 'bold', width: '35%' }}>Category</TableCell>
                    <TableCell sx={{ fontWeight: 'bold', width: '35%' }}>Created By</TableCell>
                  </TableRow>
                </TableHead>
                <TableBody>
                  {voucherList
                    .slice(page * rowsPerPage, page * rowsPerPage + rowsPerPage)
                    .map((row) => {
                      const isSelected = selectedVoucher?.id === row.id;
                      const isExpanded = expandedRow === row.id;

                      return (
                        <React.Fragment key={row.id}>
                          {/* MAIN ROW */}
                          <TableRow 
                            hover 
                            onClick={() => {
                              setSelectedVoucher(row);
                              handleRowExpand(row.id); // Triggers the smooth collapse
                            }}
                            sx={{ 
                              cursor: 'pointer',
                              backgroundColor: isSelected ? "action.selected" : "inherit",
                              '& > *': { borderBottom: isExpanded ? 'none' : '1px solid rgba(224, 224, 224, 1)' } 
                            }}
                          >
                            <TableCell padding="checkbox">
                              <Radio checked={isSelected} color="primary" />
                            </TableCell>
                            <TableCell sx={{ whiteSpace: "nowrap", overflow: "hidden", textOverflow: "ellipsis" }}>
                              {row.vid}
                            </TableCell>
                            <TableCell sx={{ whiteSpace: "nowrap", overflow: "hidden", textOverflow: "ellipsis" }}>
                              {row.category || "General"}
                            </TableCell>
                            <TableCell sx={{ whiteSpace: "nowrap", overflow: "hidden", textOverflow: "ellipsis" }}>
                              {row.createdBy || "System"}
                            </TableCell>
                          </TableRow>
                          
                          {/* EXPANDABLE ROW CONTENT (Description Only) */}
                          <TableRow sx={{ backgroundColor: "background.default" }}>
                            {/* Notice colSpan is now 4 to match the new column count */}
                            <TableCell style={{ paddingBottom: 0, paddingTop: 0, borderBottom: isExpanded ? '1px solid rgba(224, 224, 224, 1)' : 'none' }} colSpan={4}>
                              <Collapse in={isExpanded} timeout="auto" unmountOnExit>
                                <Box sx={{ margin: 2, p: 2, backgroundColor: "#f8f9fa", borderRadius: 2, border: "1px solid #e0e0e0" }}>
                                  <Typography variant="body2" color="text.secondary">
                                    <strong style={{ color: "black" }}>Description:</strong> {row.description || "No description provided for this voucher configuration."}
                                  </Typography>
                                </Box>
                              </Collapse>
                            </TableCell>
                          </TableRow>
                        </React.Fragment>
                      );
                    })}
                  {voucherList.length === 0 && (
                     <TableRow>
                       <TableCell colSpan={4} align="center" sx={{ py: 3 }}>
                         No configurations found.
                       </TableCell>
                     </TableRow>
                  )}
                </TableBody>
              </Table>
            </TableContainer>
            <TablePagination
              rowsPerPageOptions={[5, 10, 25]}
              component="div"
              count={voucherList.length}
              rowsPerPage={rowsPerPage}
              page={page}
              onPageChange={handleChangePage}
              onRowsPerPageChange={handleChangeRowsPerPage}
            />
          </Paper>

```
